WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.271
.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:07.774 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELL, SPEAKING OF

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:09.342 line:78%
LYING, IT'S HAPPENING RIGHT IN

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:11.911 line:78%
FRONT OF US.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:13.980 line:78%
IT HAS BEEN MORE THAN A MONTH

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:16.483 line:78%
SINCE PAUL PELOSI WAS ATTACKED

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.785 line:78%
IN HIS HOME ON A FRIDAY NIGHT IN

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:22.722 line:78%
SAN FRANCISCO.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:25.992 line:78%
THE ASSAILANT, A HIPPIE NUDIST,

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:29.529 line:78%
A RIGHT WING EXTREMIST, DESPITE

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:31.965 line:78%
BEING A BLACK MATTER LIVES FAN.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:33.299 line:78%
PAUL PELOSI DIDN'T SEEM AFRAID

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.934 line:78%
OF DEPAPE.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.468 line:78%
IN FACT HE OPENED THE DOOR FOR

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.303 line:78%
THE COPS HIMSELF.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:39.139 line:78%
WHAT HAPPENED IN THE PELOSI

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.573 line:78%
HOUSE THAT NIGHT?

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:42.142 line:78%
A LOT OF CONSPIRACY THEORIES

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.876 line:78%
ABOUT IT, AND PEOPLE WHO PUT

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.610 line:78%
THOSE FORWARD HAVE BEEN ATTACKED

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.778 line:78%
FOR IT.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.579 line:78%
YOU'RE CRAZY.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.580 line:78%
SO THERE'S ONE WAY TO END THIS

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.481 line:78%
DEBATE IMMEDIATELY.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.049 line:78%
IT WOULD BE A CONSTITUTIONAL WAY

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.317 line:78%
TO END IT.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.718 line:78%
IN FACT, WE SHOULD BE DEMANDING

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:53.586 line:78%
IT.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:55.321 line:78%
THAT'S TO SEE THE BODY CAM

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:57.290 line:78%
FOOTAGE FROM THAT NIGHT, BECAUSE

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:58.124 line:78%
THESE POLICE ARE PUBLIC

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.793 line:78%
SERVANTS, WORK FOR THE REST OF

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.193 line:78%
US, AND HAVE NO RIGHT TO HIDE

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.462 line:78%
THAT.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:04.097 line:78%
BUT THE POLICE, FOR SOME REASON,

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:06.599 line:78%
HAVE REFUSED TO RELEASE THAT

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:07.934 line:78%
BODY CAM FOOTAGE.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:09.969 line:78%
WE GET BODY CAM FOOTAGE EVERY

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:11.805 line:78%
DAY IN THE NEWS BUSINESS.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.072 line:78%
THEY'RE INTENT ON NOT RELEASING

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:16.242 line:78%
IT.

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:20.780 line:78%
IN DEPAPE'S FEDERAL COURT CASE,

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:21.347 line:78%
A JUDGE ISSUED A BAN FROM

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.415 line:78%
RELEASING IT.

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:24.217 line:78%
WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:25.485 line:78%
WHY ARE THEY HIDING THIS?

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.553 line:78%
IS THERE A GOOD REASON?

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.188 line:78%
WE DON'T KNOW.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.589 line:78%
LARRY ELDER RAN FOR GOVERNOR IN

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.924 line:78%
CALIFORNIA, A STATE IN WHICH

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:33.159 line:78%
HE'S LIVED FOR MANY YEARS.

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.060 line:78%
HE JOINS US TO ASSESS WHAT'S

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:36.362 line:78%
GOING ON HERE.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:38.198 line:78%
LARRY, THANKS FOR COMING ON.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:39.099 line:78%
WHY CAN'T WE END THIS

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:40.033 line:78%
CONVERSATION WITH THE EVIDENCE

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:42.368 line:78%
THAT WE HAVE A RIGHT TO SEE?

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.403 line:78%
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE, WE'RE SPECULATING,

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:44.637 line:78%
BUT SOMEBODY DOES NOT WANT

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:46.106 line:78%
SOMEBODY TO KNOW WHAT REALLY

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.307 line:78%
HAPPENED THAT DAY.

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:49.776 line:78%
I DON'T KNOW.

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:51.211 line:78%
THE NBC REPORTER, WHO REPORTED

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:52.979 line:78%
THAT PELOSI CALMLY OPENED THE

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:56.082 line:78%
DOOR, SAID HE HAD A HAMMER IN

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:56.483 line:78%
HIS HAND, AND CALMLY WALKED

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.650 line:78%
BACK.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:59.252 line:78%
THAT GUY GOT SUSPENDED.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:01.387 line:78%
WE DON'T KNOW WHAT'S HAPPENING.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.788 line:78%
WE HAVEN'T SEEN ANY FOOTAGE, ANY

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:03.022 line:78%
AUDIO.

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:05.725 line:78%
WE DON'T KNOW WHAT THE WITNESSES

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:07.994 line:78%
ARE SAYING.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:10.163 line:78%
MAYBE PAUL PELOSI KNEW THE GUY.

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:11.397 line:78%
MAYBE NANCY PELOSI KNEW THE GUY.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:12.765 line:78%
MAYBE PAUL INVITED HIM IN.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.367 line:78%
WE JUST DON'T KNOW.

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:17.237 line:78%
ALL I KNOW IS THAT THE OFFICIAL

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:20.140 line:78%
STORY THAT WE'VE HEARD, WHICH IS

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:22.208 line:78%
VERY SIMPLE, THIS GUY BROKE INTO

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.243 line:78%
PAUL PELOSI'S HOUSE AND ATTACKED

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.643 line:78%
HIM DOES NOT APPEAR TO BE THE

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:27.046 line:78%
CASE.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:28.648 line:78%
OTHERWISE WHY SO SECRETIVE?

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:31.017 line:78%
WHY NOT TELL WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:34.354 line:78%
WHY THE GAG ORDER?

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:35.955 line:78%
I'VE NEVER SEEN.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:37.557 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'VE MET PAUL PELOSI,

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:39.159 line:78%
AND HE'S A VERY NICE MAN.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:44.197 line:78%
I WOULDN'T BE DOING THE STORY

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:46.466 line:78%
RIGHT NOW IF THEY HADN'T USED IT

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.833 line:78%
TO ATTACK THEIR POLITICAL

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.268 line:78%
OPPONENTS?

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:49.736 line:78%
THEY USED THIS STORY TO ATTACK

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.837 line:78%
THEIR POLITICAL OPPONENTS.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:53.006 line:78%
WE HAVE AN ABSOLUTE RIGHT AND

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:53.773 line:78%
OBLIGATION TO GET TO THE BOTTOM

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:55.208 line:78%
OF IT, CORRECT?

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.976 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:58.978 line:78%
I SAID SOMETHING SNARKY ABOUT IT

00:02:57.076 --> 00:03:01.881 line:78%
AFTER I MADE SURE THAT PAUL

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:03.383 line:78%
PELOSI WAS GOING TO RECOVER

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:08.154 line:78%
FULLY, AND I WAS ATTACKED, AND

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:09.722 line:78%
OTHER CONSERVATIVES ATTACKED.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:11.090 line:78%
YOU'RE QUITE RIGHT, WE OUGHT TO

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:13.660 line:78%
KNOW WHAT THE STORY IS.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:15.295 line:78%
IT WAS USED TO SHOW HOW

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:19.299 line:78%
INSENSITIVE AND CALLOUS

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:19.666 line:78%
CONSERVATIVES ARE BEFORE THE

00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:20.900 line:78%
MIDTERMS.

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:23.970 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THEY'LL USE ANYTHING,

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:27.240 line:78%
EVEN HER HUSBAND'S ATTACK, AS

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:27.607 line:78%
YOU WELL KNOW, HAVING BEEN

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:28.241 line:78%
ATTACKED.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:28.241 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I'M THE BLACK FACE 

